</td></tr><tr><td>The Sword of Ssraeshza</td><td>0</td><td>7</td><td>13</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Timestone Adorned Ring</td><td>0</td><td>6</td><td>12</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>Tiny Bone Bracelet</td><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>5</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>Ton Po's Chestwraps of Composure</td><td>0</td><td>9</td><td>19</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td>Ton Po's Leggings of Composure</td><td>40</td><td>42</td><td>45</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>Ton Po's Sandals of Composure</td><td>20</td><td>22</td><td>23</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>Ton Po's Sleeves of Composure</td><td>30</td><td>32</td><td>33</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><td>Trydan's Armplates of Nobility</td><td>25</td><td>27</td><td>28</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>Trydan's Bracer of Nobility</td><td>15</td><td>16</td><td>18</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td>Trydan's Chestplate of Nobility</td><td>0</td><td>9</td><td>19</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td>Trydan's Gauntlets of Nobility</td><td>30</td><td>32</td><td>33</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><td>Trydan's Greaves of Nobility</td><td>40</td><td>42</td><td>45</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>Trydan's Helm of Nobility</td><td>0</td><td>6</td><td>13</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td>Valiant Belt of Fallen Heroes</td><td>0</td><td>4</td><td>8</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Vanazir, Dreamer's Despair</td><td>0</td><td>5</td><td>10</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Vengeful Mail of the Void</td><td>0</td><td>6</td><td>11</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td>Visor of Endless Sight</td><td>0</td><td>3</td><td>7</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Warden's Buckler</td><td>0</td><td>4</td><td>8</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Whispering Air Bangle</td><td>20</td><td>22</td><td>23</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>Winged Storm Boots</td><td>0</td><td>4</td><td>9</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>Wristband of Icy Vengeance</td><td>0</td><td>3</td><td>7</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Wristband of Judgement</td><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Yttrium Studded Mantle</td><td>0</td><td>4</td><td>8</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Yttrium Wrapped 